{"sha": "d2cb88e30b7313195bda82842552a2964b415779779d21b7e9fb058fb2ef6b10", "body": ["\\chapter{三角函数：单位圆}\\label{ch:g11:trigo}", "", "三角函数始于直角三角形，但其真正的归宿是", "\\emph{单位圆}，在其上余弦与正弦成为任意", "实数的函数。本章引入弧度、实数轴在圆周上的卷绕、", "需要熟记的特殊值，以及生成全部经典恒等式的对称性。", "关于 $\\cos$ 与 $\\sin$ 作为函数的研究 ---", "即其变化与导数 ---", "在\\cref{ch:g12:trigo}中进行。", "", "\\section{弧度与卷绕}", "", "\\begin{definition}[弧度]\\label{def:g11:trigo:radian}", "设 $\\mathcal C$ 为半径为 $1$、以原点 $O$ 为圆心的圆，", "并设 $I(1, 0)$。圆心角的\\emph{弧度}\\index{弧度}量", "是顶点位于 $\\mathcal C$ 圆心处的角在 $\\mathcal C$ 上所截弧的长度。", "由于整个圆的周长为 $2\\pi$：", "\\[", "360^\\circ = 2\\pi \\text{ 弧度},", "\\qquad", "180^\\circ = \\pi \\text{ 弧度},", "\\qquad", "1 \\text{ 弧度} = \\frac{180^\\circ}{\\pi} \\approx 57.3^\\circ .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{method}[换算]\\label{met:g11:trigo:convert}", "角度与弧度成正比：由角度化为弧度乘以 $\\frac{\\pi}{180}$，", "由弧度化为角度则乘以 $\\frac{180}{\\pi}$。例如", "$60^\\circ = 60 \\times \\frac{\\pi}{180} = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$，且", "$\\frac{3\\pi}{4} = \\frac{3 \\times 180^\\circ}{4} = 135^\\circ$。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{definition}[实数轴在圆上的卷绕]\\label{def:g11:trigo:winding}", "对每个实数 $t$，对应点 $M(t)$，该点位于 $\\mathcal C$ 上，", "通过沿圆周走过长度 $\\abs t$ 得到，起点为 $I$，", "当 $t \\geq 0$ 时沿逆时针方向，当 $t < 0$ 时沿顺时针方向。由于", "圆周长为 $2\\pi$，数 $t$ 与 $t + 2k\\pi$（$k \\in \\Z$）", "对应同一点，即 $M(t + 2k\\pi) = M(t)$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}", "$M(0) = I$；$M\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = (0, 1)$，即圆的最高点；", "$M(\\pi) = (-1, 0)$；$M\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right) = (0, -1)$；", "且 $M\\!\\left(\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\\right) = M\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} +", "2\\pi\\right) = M\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{余弦与正弦}", "", "\\begin{definition}[余弦与正弦]\\label{def:g11:trigo:cossin}", "对每个实数 $t$，$t$ 的\\emph{余弦}\\index{余弦}与", "\\emph{正弦}\\index{正弦}分别是", "单位圆上点 $M(t)$ 的坐标：", "\\[", "M(t) = (\\cos t,\\ \\sin t).", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=2.0]", "  \\draw[->] (-1.3,0) -- (1.4,0) node[right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[->] (0,-1.3) -- (0,1.4) node[above] {$y$};", "  \\draw[gray] (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\coordinate (O) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (M) at (55:1);", "  \\draw[thick,omDef] (O) -- (M);", "  \\draw[dashed] (M) -- (M |- O) node[below, font=\\small] {$\\cos t$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (M) -- (M -| O) node[left, font=\\small] {$\\sin t$};", "  \\draw[->,omThm,thick] (0.35,0) arc (0:55:0.35);", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (27:0.55) {$t$};", "  \\fill (M) circle (0.7pt) node[above right] {$M(t)$};", "  \\fill (1,0) circle (0.7pt) node[below right] {$I$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 单位圆：实数 $t$，自", "$I$ 出发逆时针卷绕，落在点 $M(t)$ 上，其坐标\\emph{定义}了 $\\cos t$", "和 $\\sin t$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[基本性质]\\label{prop:g11:trigo:first}", "对任意 $t \\in \\R$ 及 $k \\in \\Z$，有", "\\[", "-1 \\leq \\cos t \\leq 1, \\qquad", "-1 \\leq \\sin t \\leq 1, \\qquad", "\\cos^2 t + \\sin^2 t = 1,", "\\]", "\\[", "\\cos(t + 2k\\pi) = \\cos t, \\qquad \\sin(t + 2k\\pi) = \\sin t .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$M(t)$ 位于单位圆上，故其坐标介于 $-1$ 与", "$1$ 之间，且满足圆的方程 $x^2 + y^2 = 1$，这即是", "恒等式 $\\cos^2 t + \\sin^2 t = 1$。周期性", "只是重述 $M(t + 2k\\pi) = M(t)$（见\\cref{def:g11:trigo:winding}）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:trigo:identity}", "若 $\\sin t = \\frac35$，且 $t \\in \\intcc{\\frac\\pi2}{\\pi}$（第二", "象限），则 $\\cos^2 t = 1 - \\frac{9}{25} = \\frac{16}{25}$，所以", "$\\cos t = \\pm\\frac45$；第二象限中横坐标为负，", "因此 $\\cos t = -\\frac45$。", "\\end{example}", "", "需熟记的特殊值：", "\\begin{center}", "\\begin{tabular}{c|ccccc}", "$t$ & $0$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$ & $\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$\\\\[6pt]", "\\hline\\rule{0pt}{14pt}%", "$\\cos t$ & $1$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ & $\\dfrac12$ & $0$\\\\[6pt]", "$\\sin t$ & $0$ & $\\dfrac12$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}{2}$ & $\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ & $1$", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", ""]}